#lang rhombus/static
// SPDX-License-Identifier: 0BSD
// Adapted HOL expression is confined to kernel_generated.rhm; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

// Public compatibility boundary for the Isabelle-generated LCF kernel.
// The generated module decides every primitive inference and theory extension;
// this module supplies opaque public values, stable errors, queries, trace
// events, and canonical printing, without reimplementing generated validity
// checks.

